/* Port Vanta voices. No allocation, no gameplay RNG, no time or save reads.
   A session caller tracks visits independently for each stable actor identity.
   Use npc_greet_line(archetype, identity, visits), then advance visits mod 50
   exactly once when dialogue opens. Redrawing must not advance the deck.

   Archetypes: 0 pedestrian, 1 officer, 2 rival, 3 cab passenger, 4 clerk,
   5 contact, 6 club patron, 7 venue staff, 8 trades/greenhouse, 9 freight.
   Each voice gets 32 lines from its role pool plus 18 local pleasantries.
   Identity selects both the subset and order, not just a random opening.
   Each sentence is authored, ASCII and <=62 characters. */
